# What the sdist carries — decided 2026-09-04 (wave 8, coordinator fix-up for F-4c607d79).
#
# Measured before this file existed: the sdist carried 112 `tests/test_*.py` selected by
# distutils' default `tests/test*.py` glob and NONE of `tests/conftest.py`, `tests/blender_stub.py`,
# `tests/fixtures/**`, or the 84 top-level `tools/*.py` those tests import — 509 collected,
# 84 collection errors from the unpacked archive. A suite that reads as self-verifying and
# cannot collect is a false record. The wheel is the product; the suite is run from the repo
# (`verify.ps1`, `ci.yml`), where its fixtures and the rig's assets exist.
#
# Decision: the sdist ships NO tests and NO experiment records. The test that pins this
# choice unpacks the built sdist and asserts it (tests/test_packaging.py).
prune tests
prune specs
prune docs
prune site
prune npm
prune outputs
recursive-exclude tools/armature_studio.egg-info *
global-exclude *.pyc
